%% Reprise - issue lifecycle state machine
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> NEW
    NEW --> TRIAGING: trusted trigger
    TRIAGING --> CONFIRMED
    TRIAGING --> FLAKY
    TRIAGING --> DUPLICATE
    TRIAGING --> NEEDS_INFO
    TRIAGING --> BLOCKED_ENV
    TRIAGING --> ERROR: budget or tool failure
    NEEDS_INFO --> TRIAGING: reporter reply or /reprise triage
    BLOCKED_ENV --> TRIAGING: /reprise triage after config fix
    ERROR --> TRIAGING: /reprise triage
    CONFIRMED --> FIXING: /reprise fix
    FLAKY --> FIXING: /reprise fix
    CONFIRMED --> VERIFYING: human PR with Fixes #N
    FLAKY --> VERIFYING: human PR with Fixes #N
    FIXING --> VERIFYING: PR opened
    FIXING --> FIX_ABANDONED: Bob produced no usable change
    FIX_ABANDONED --> FIXING: /reprise fix
    FIX_ABANDONED --> VERIFYING: human PR
    VERIFYING --> FIX_VERIFIED
    VERIFYING --> FIX_INCOMPLETE
    VERIFYING --> REGRESSION_DETECTED
    FIX_INCOMPLETE --> VERIFYING: new commits or /reprise verify
    REGRESSION_DETECTED --> VERIFYING: new commits or /reprise verify
    FIX_INCOMPLETE --> FIXING: /reprise fix
    REGRESSION_DETECTED --> FIXING: /reprise fix
    FIX_VERIFIED --> VERIFYING: new commits pushed
    FIX_VERIFIED --> RESOLVED: PR merged and issue closed
    DUPLICATE --> [*]
    RESOLVED --> [*]
